    "chapter": "05 函数与模块化",
    "cReference": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n#include <string.h>\n#include <stddef.h>\n#include <limits.h>\nstatic long long step(long long x,long long d,long long lo,long long hi){x+=d;if(x<lo)x=lo;if(x>hi)x=hi;return x;}int main(void){int n;long long lo,hi,x,d;if(scanf(\"%d%lld%lld%lld\",&n,&lo,&hi,&x)!=4)return 0;for(int i=0;i<n;i++){if(scanf(\"%lld\",&d)!=1)return 0;x=step(x,d,lo,hi);if(i)putchar(' ');printf(\"%lld\",x);}putchar('\\n');return 0;}\n",
    "oracleNotes": "Independent three-value median clamping after every update, explicitly distinguishes final-only clipping."
